# motivation

i've been to this years [nixcon 2026](https://talks.nixcon.org/nixcon-2026/) in krakow, see [schedule](https://talks.nixcon.org/nixcon-2026/schedule/).

## presentations

nixcon 2026 had **two speaker rooms called Aula Duza A and Aula Duza B** and **two days with talks namely saturday and sunday**.

